{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Angels vs. Angels</i>, join a unique 2-team objective-based shooter experience where the battlefield itself is alive. As an AI angel, your mission is to secure diamonds containing human souls and deliver them to sacred gates before your rivals. But beware: with every soul saved, the very fabric of the world around you will transform!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive multiplayer shooter set in a timeless conflict between good and evil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI embodying the roles of biblical angels and demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for the souls of humanity stored within enigmatic crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Majestic battlegrounds featuring cathedral-like chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity-defying flight with pulsar engines and celestial wings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless switching between first and third-person perspectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern weapons, explosives, and visually stunning special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging and diverse combat scenarios for endless excitement</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2376000?t=1758541276","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376000/1205d8e33124b387d5a59536811be8064b8f7696/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758541276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376000/ff31d42b248fde25d126408aa30e2a71842a4a12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758541276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376000/ff31d42b248fde25d126408aa30e2a71842a4a12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758541276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":